      "updated": 1792257823540,
      "created": 1792133031794,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "How to Insert the node?\n\nif *queue == NULL \n    -> *queue = node -> return\nelse\n    convert (tree_size + 1) / 2 to binary string representation\n    exemple: (10 + 1) / 2 = 5 = 101\n\n101 represente the path to the target node\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "How to Insert the node?\n\nif *queue == NULL \n    -> *queue = node -> return\nelse\n    convert (tree_size + 1) / 2 to binary string representation\n    exemple: (10 + 1) / 2 = 5 = 101\n\n101 represente the path to the target node\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
